:"以商店數量計算，我們是美國最大的折扣零售商，截至 2026 年 2 月 27 日，我們在美國 48 個州和墨西哥擁有 20,959 家商店，其中商店最集中在美國南部、西南部、中西部和東部。我們在墨西哥的第一家商店於 2023 年開業。我們提供多種商品選擇，包括消費品、季節性商品、家居用品和服裝。我們的商品包括來自領先製造商的國家品牌，以及我們自己的自有品牌選擇，價格比民族品牌有大幅折扣。我們在便利的小賣場以每日低價（通常為 10 美元或以下）為客戶提供這些國家品牌和自有品牌產品。"},{"en":"J.L. Turner founded our Company in 1939 as J.L. Turner and Son, Wholesale. We were incorporated as a Kentucky corporation under the name J.L. Turner & Son, Inc. in 1955, when we opened our first Dollar General store. We changed our name to Dollar General Corporation in 1968 and reincorporated in 1998 as a Tennessee corporation. Our common stock was publicly traded from 1968 until July 2007, when we merged with an entity controlled by investment funds affiliated with Kohlberg Kravis Roberts & Co. L.P., or KKR. In November 2009 our common stock again became publicly traded on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol \"DG\", and in December 2013 the entity controlled by investment funds affiliated with KKR sold its remaining shares of our common stock.","zh":"J.L. Turner 於 1939 年創立了我們公司，名為 J.L. Turner and Son, Wholesale。 1955 年，我們以 J.L. Turner & Son, Inc. 的名義註冊為肯塔基州公司，並開設了第一家 Dollar General 商店。 1968 年，我們更名為 Dollar General Corporation，並於 1998 年重組為田納西州公司。我們的普通股從 1968 年開始公開交易，直到 2007 年 7 月，我們與 Kohlberg Kravis Roberts & Co. L.P.（簡稱 KKR）附屬投資基金控制的實體合併。 2009 年 11 月，我們的普通股再次在紐約證券交易所公開交易，代號為“DG”，2013 年 12 月，KKR 附屬投資基金控制的實體出售了我們剩餘的普通股。"},{"en":"Our long history of profitable growth is founded on a commitment to a relatively simple business model: providing a broad base of customers with their basic everyday and household needs, supplemented with a variety of general merchandise items, at everyday low prices in conveniently located, small-box stores. We continually evaluate the needs and demands of our customers and modify our merchandise selections and pricing accordingly, while remaining focused on increasing profitability, cash generation and returns for our shareholders.","zh":"我們悠久的獲利成長歷史建立在對相對簡單的商業模式的承諾之上：為廣大客戶提供基本的日常和家庭需求，並在位置便利的小賣場以每日低價提供各種日用商品作為補充。我們不斷評估客戶的需求，並相應地修改我們的商品選擇和定價，同時繼續專注於提高獲利能力、現金產生和股東回報。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our customers seek value and convenience. Depending on their financial situation and geographic proximity, customers' reliance on Dollar General varies from fill-in shopping, to making periodic trips to stock up on household items, to making weekly or more frequent trips to meet most essential needs. We generally locate our stores and plan our merchandise selections to best serve the needs of our core customers, the low and fixed income households often underserved by other retailers (including grocers), and we are focused on helping them make the most of their spending dollars. At the same time, however, Dollar General shoppers from a wide range of income brackets and life stages appreciate our quality merchandise as well as our attractive value and convenience proposition.","zh":"我們的客戶尋求價值和便利。根據其財務狀況和地理位置的不同，顧客對 Dollar General 的依賴程度各不相同，從補充性購物到定期出行購買家居用品，再到每週或更頻繁的出行以滿足最基本的需求。我們通常會選擇商店並規劃商品選擇，以最好地滿足核心客戶的需求，這些客戶是其他零售商（包括雜貨店）經常得不到充分服務的低收入和固定收入家庭，我們致力於幫助他們充分利用他們的支出。但同時，來自不同收入階層和人生階段的 Dollar General 購物者都欣賞我們的優質商品以及有吸引力的價值和便利主張。"},{"en":"We purchase merchandise from a wide variety of suppliers and maintain direct buying relationships with many producers of national brand merchandise. Despite our broad offering, we maintain a relatively limited number of items per category, which supports our low average cost. Our two largest suppliers accounted for approximately 11% and 8%, respectively, of our purchases in 2025. Our private brands come from a wide variety of suppliers. We directly imported approximately 4% of our purchases at cost in 2025.","zh":"我們從各種供應商購買商品，並與許多民族品牌商品生產商保持直接購買關係。儘管我們提供廣泛的產品，但每個類別的商品數量相對有限，這支持了我們較低的平均成本。 2025 年，我們最大的兩家供應商分別占我們採購量的約 11% 和 8%。我們的自有品牌來自各種各樣的供應商。 2025 年，我們約 4% 的採購量以成本價直接進口。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-30","items":[{"name":"Consumables","val":35053180000,"zh":"耗材"},{"name":"Seasonal","val":4327364000,"zh":"季節性"},{"name":"Home Products","val":2213521000,"zh":"首頁 產品展示"},{"name":"Apparel","val":1130304000,"zh":"服飾"}],"total":42724369000}},"peers":["DLTR","TJX","ROST","ULTA","AZO"]}}